<subpara id="RM00000160F01TX_03" type-id="51" category="05" proc-id="RM0550J___00002TW00001">
<name>Inspection Procedure</name>
<content5 releasenbr="1">
<atten3>
<ptxt>Inspect the fuses for circuits related to this system before performing the following troubleshooting.</ptxt>
</atten3>
<atten4>
<ptxt>Using SST (TaSCAN), read the freeze data. Freeze data records part of the engine operating condition when a malfunction occurs, and this information is useful when troubleshooting.</ptxt>
</atten4>
</content5>
</subpara>
<subpara id="RM00000160F01TX_10" type-id="01" category="01">
